{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四月のグリーティングカードは、ぺーちゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーちゃんはライブの前に、ヤー の他にも\nワッショイ!\nなども叫んでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを聞くと、こっちも気合が入ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次に聞けるのは、4月6日のライブかな〜〜(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\nめちゃくちゃ楽しみです❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、新宿のビレッジバンガードに行って、世紀末さんの本を買いに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"売り切れでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念｡ﾟ(ﾟˆoˆﾟ)ﾟ｡｡ﾟ(ﾟˆoˆﾟ)ﾟ｡｡ﾟ(ﾟˆoˆﾟ)ﾟ｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、Amazonさんに頼みます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、キーホルダーを買いました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3HNFG904Q0RS4JTSJRRRH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nきゃぴ子ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本は買えなかったけど、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3HPXERRKGC1DN14DMJXHS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nサインが見れました｡+.ﾟ.( °∀°)ﾟ+.ﾟ｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付けます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3HRQ8BD2YP2M2JJCJMG64","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nステッカーなども売っていて、とても可愛かったです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった朝ごはん。\n久しぶりのパン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3HT7CC9M3BWZ5GDQ1BGD8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生クリーム系よりもチーズ系のケーキが好きです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3HVXK5E7MSKX5S7WEGV3J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nチーズケーキ大好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}